{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wee Boats is a casual online sailing game where you can relax, explore and most importantly, honk your horn!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >See The Sights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wee Boats universe has 5 different regions for you to find and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/1ceff48e23ee4490e8c834a699fe299c.poster.avif?t=1773491655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/1ceff48e23ee4490e8c834a699fe299c.webm?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/1ceff48e23ee4490e8c834a699fe299c.mp4?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boat with Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the gang together and explore with friends! Honk to your hearts content! If you would prefer to sail in the serenity of your own company, you can always play offline. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/c9f2dc948a31b610285664d407b83e25.poster.avif?t=1773491655\" width=704 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/c9f2dc948a31b610285664d407b83e25.webm?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/c9f2dc948a31b610285664d407b83e25.mp4?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different hats. Different sizes. On your wee boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/229de2a88dc8856af5c6fe16888f79a5.avif?t=1773491655\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras_big/229de2a88dc8856af5c6fe16888f79a5.avif?t=1773491655 width=1560 height=822 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All the Boats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have a wide selection of micro watercrafts! And remember, the captain doesn't choose the boat. The boat chooses the captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/87792493ca1561b35a51942cb8ad48ac.poster.avif?t=1773491655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/87792493ca1561b35a51942cb8ad48ac.webm?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/87792493ca1561b35a51942cb8ad48ac.mp4?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Log Your Finds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of all the discoveries that you come across in your own Ship's Logbook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/4fef01ad5373d39e7c1b74052db800e7.poster.avif?t=1773491655\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/4fef01ad5373d39e7c1b74052db800e7.webm?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/4fef01ad5373d39e7c1b74052db800e7.mp4?t=1773491655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Based On True Boats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wee Boats is a love letter to the cultural icons of the area around where the game was developed. This is me with the game's star, Beffen, when it was in boat hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/74da0f74b874aeccb2d024d56ffafebb.avif?t=1773491655\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras_big/74da0f74b874aeccb2d024d56ffafebb.avif?t=1773491655 width=800 height=1066 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the game! Big Love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578080?t=1773491655","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578080?t=1773491655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/26dab3cb0bc8cf8d5945bb25f0b0726528e8a97d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773491655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/26dab3cb0bc8cf8d5945bb25f0b0726528e8a97d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773491655","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wee Boats is a casual online sailing game where you can relax, explore and most importantly, honk your horn!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >See T